     windows that already existed when it started (dde-desktop, dde-shell) as
     SPONTANEOUS at every login. They are now a recorded BASELINE, so the log
     only ever flags windows that really appeared later. Everything else is
     1.5.8 unchanged (the ghost-key root-cause fix, RDP, log viewer, wireless
     toggle, hardware gate).
