Description: Fihri OS 1.0 Service Pack 1 — update feed, P1 parity, network, dock, launcher and visual fixes
  1.5.4 (2026-11-23) — RDP session management: reconnecting to the same
   host always works (the stale client that holds the server single
   connection slot is killed first), the session end is monitored and a
   desktop notification tells the user, and the connection auto-resumes
   across network blips (+auto-reconnect). The RDP window is now freely
   resizable on ANY server (/smart-sizing) with live resolution on
   supporting servers (/dynamic-resolution), plus the fullscreen checkbox.
  1.5.3 (2026-11-22) — RDP clipboard confirmed bidirectional (+clipboard) and
   the window is now RESIZABLE with live resolution updates
   (/dynamic-resolution - resize/maximize the window and the remote desktop
   follows), plus an Open-in-fullscreen checkbox (Ctrl+Alt+Enter toggles
   fullscreen at runtime).
  1.5.2 (2026-11-22) — network plugin REPAIRED (the 1.5.1 standalone-tree
   rebuild segfaulted under the deployed loader and the wireless/network window
   disappeared; the stock plugin is now shipped and restored, and the hplip
   hold that broke the Update Center selective upgrade is released).
  1.5.1 (2026-11-21) — RDP client fix (the TLX build SEGFAULTS; the distro
   xfreerdp is now preferred with automatic fallback, and a collapsible
   connection log with full output is kept on the error page), Update Center
   no longer offers held packages (the exit-100 "Held packages were changed"
   refusal), and the wireless network panel is wider (330 -> 390 px) so the
   radio on/off toggle is fully visible.
  1.5.0 (2026-11-20) — user-facing fix batch:
   - Update Center no longer shows stale updates after a terminal apt upgrade
     (dpkg-status polling auto-refreshes the list and the tray counter).
   - Update Center only lists updates from official origins (Ubuntu, the
     Fihri GitHub feed, the local /opt/canlinux-repo pool); PPA and unknown
     sources are hidden.
   - `apt update` output is clean: fetch lines of the local /opt repo are
     hidden, while Ubuntu/GitHub/Brave errors are still shown. Translation
     fetch noise removed.
   - The wireless password field and buttons are English (locale forced to
     en_US, Chinese locales removed from the locale archive).
   - Save As dialogs offer the New Folder button again.
