     rule + fihri-bt-power-on@.service oneshot that explicitly powers every
     newly enumerated hciN adapter UP (btmgmt/bluetoothctl).
  4. Quick Actions for every user (defect #5): system-wide
     /usr/local/bin/canlinux-widgets-toggle + desktop entry (both
     /usr/share/applications and /usr/local/share/applications) + the
     x-scheme-handler/canlinux-widgets-toggle default in /etc/xdg/mimeapps.list.
  5. Regenerates /opt/canlinux-repo/Packages, Packages.gz, and Release.
