     plate is painted by dde-shell from its app-id-scoped theme preference and
     the text by the tray plugins from the app-id-less generic one; the DARKDOCK
     era left per-app overrides behind (live: generic=0, dde-shell=0,
     dde-dock=1), so the two disagreed and text rendered black on the dark
     plate. Both sides now resolve ONE authority — the appearance daemon's
     active style (".dark"/".light"), generic themeType only as fallback — and
     the popup delegates use the locked pair unconditionally.
